				{
					"id": 411271301,
					"content": "I'll help you out.",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						411271302
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 411271302,
					"content": "That's great. Now, let me think... While I can't remember the details, I was wandering around the Thousand Winds Temple earlier...",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						411271303
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Viktor"
				},
				{
					"id": 411271303,
					"content": "But as I was running back, I encountered a large group Electro Slimes. I got careless and took a few hits from them, and the box fell out...",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						411271304
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Viktor"
				},
				{
					"id": 411271304,
					"content": "Now, I did manage to grab it back, but... I wound up losing it again in my haste.",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						411271305
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Viktor"
				},
				{
					"id": 411271305,
					"content": "Still, since the box was touched by those Electro Slimes, it should have some elemental traces on it.",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						411271306
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Viktor"
				},
				{
					"id": 411271306,
					"content": "In any case, try following the trail of Electro traces and see what you can find.",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						411271307
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Viktor"
				},
				{
					"id": 411271307,
					"content": "Once you've found the box, bring it back to me.",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						411271308
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Viktor"
				},
				{
					"id": 411271308,
					"content": "Well... <color=#00E1FFFF>you can also come back and look for me if you really can't find it</color>.",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						411271309
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Viktor"
				},
				{
					"id": 411271309,
					"content": "I'll give it a bit more thought. Maybe I'll remember something...",
